Did you know that we now run African Drumming courses in Noosa!? NEW course starts June 2nd @ The J on Monday evenings 6-7pm.  All ages 8+ and all levels. Drums provided. Come and try something NEW! Be immersed in traditional West African rhythms. Learn djembe and dundun ensemble parts. Regular student performance opportunities! You won't regret it![![Rhythm Culture Workshop](/media/2014/05/Rhythm-Culture-Workshop.jpg)](/media/2014/05/Rhythm-Culture-Workshop.jpg)
